# Developer practice

- Pull `main` before branching. Keep the PR small and about one thing.
- Match existing PHP style. Do not add comments or docs the user did not need.
- Family-readable copy. Guidance, not a guarantee. Never a fake/safe stamp.
- Login, billing, and privacy changes stay conservative: no user enumeration, no autoplay video, keep trial personal data readable, do not sell it.
- After UI changes, verify the flow (browser if possible). Check other pages that share the same state.
- Hostinger zip is the contents of `php/` at the public_html root, never a nested folder.
- Demo login is `family@ourcircle.app` / `password123` when `SHOW_DEMO_LOGIN=1`.
- Help chat uses `XAI_API_KEY` from server `.env` (console.x.ai), not the Cursor login.
- If the open Cursor window is InPmnt, still edit only this repo.
